*      ROUTINE TO SIMULATE ON-LINE PUNCH.                               IOP07370
*      IT FLIPS THE IMAGE THEREFORE EVERTHING IS PUNCHED BINARY.        IOP07380
*      IT USES THE TOP OF QNBUF FOR OUTPUT BUFFER                       IOP07390
 PNCHA EQU     QNBUF+60            STORAGE FOR PUNCH OUT                IOP07400
 IOZ3  IORD    PNCHA,,27                                                IOP07410
 PNCRT AXT     24,4                FIXUP OUTPUT COUNTER                 IOP07420
       LXA     QIORD,2             FIX INPUT STARTING ADDRESS           IOP07430
       TXI     *+1,2,24            ADD 24 TO STARTING ADDRESS           IOP07440
