       SLW     ADFX1                                                    IOP07590
       AXT     36,2                RESTORE BIT DROP OFF                 IOP07600
 LPP4  TIX     LPP2,4,1            TEST FOR 36 BITS IN AC               IOP07610
       LXA     QTEMP,4             BRING OUTPUT COUNTER UP              IOP07620
       SLW     PNCHA+24,4          STO AC IN OUT AREA                   IOP07630
       TIX     LPP3,4,1            TEST END OF OUTPUT                   IOP07640
       TDOA    *,,2                TEST PUNCH BUSY                      IOP07650
       WRS     665,,3              PUNCH CARD                           IOP07660
